source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: A Monospace Span body consumes the backslash before `?` like any other escape, so conversion back reads the bare character.
-- input.jira --
{{a\?b}}
-- rendered.html --
<p><tt>a&#63;b</tt></p>
-- want.md --
`a?b`
-- warnings.json --
[]
